// CN0125 is the native CHECK_FORM reply on the unpromoted v0.1.25 draft; that it is Codex's, relayed by Devon 2026-11-13 23:42, is
// Claude's record and is not in its bytes. Cited by: the CHANGE 0.1.26 note, R_REC_TRANSITION's last sentence and the R_REC_Q2
// line of the recombination readings. No obligation's LAW_CLAUSE cites it.
// CEFF is the reading of enough-for-fold on link 2 → 3 that Devon relayed 2026-11-14 00:15; that it is Codex's and that time are
// Claude's record and are not in its bytes. Its report E77B5F46…1F98 and the native bytes it names are not held by Claude (CEFF L3,
// L28). Rested on, outside the CHANGE notes, by: the last three sentences of R_REC_TRANSITION, its line of the recombination
// readings, the second obligation's REQUIRED, the notes for the fourth vector and that vector. No obligation's LAW_CLAUSE cites it.
// SAY rows: S07 L19 ("…a structure the fabric universe needs").
