// R_REC_ONE          IF_THEN (U); CRJA L17 carries no verdict word of its own. Held: "the carrier configuration, junction identities and incidence, with the
//                    successor’s uniform-NO field" (C1725 L45).
// R_REC_Q1           IF_THEN (U); the contact's word is "SAME" (CRJA L25).
// R_REC_Q2           IF_THEN (U); the contact's words are "SAME under the bound recombination account" (CRJA L26). Beside it:
//                    "q₂ as an invariant := SAME of the polarity reading across the fold, member by member and by identity. It is not
//                    equality of sums." (R198 L20–L21, a PROPOSE note written for links 6 → 7 and 7 → 8). Codex reads it on link 2 → 3:
//                    "On the preserved coupled whole, domains 4/9 remain THIS→THIS and witness members 0/3 remain NO→NO. The twelve
//                    changing flag readings are a different operand. No arithmetic balancing or per-root signs are needed." (CN0125 L43).
// R_REC_DELTA        IF_THEN, in the contacts' own word (CRJA L27; C1727 L15, L17; CPLR L16); discharged witness RDISCH L4–L13.
// R_REC_NO_REMAINDER IF_THEN (U); CRJA L19 and C1727 L12 carry no verdict word of their own.
