//                    "IF_THEN on link 2 → 3." (CEFF L1); "That supplies MUST BECAUSE the reaction’s own coupling operands satisfy
//                    its internal switch into folding." (CEFF L24); "Neither the occurrence of the effect alone nor the count of
//                    twelve edits supplies this conclusion." (CEFF L24).
